 (Debby Ryan) riceve in dono una scatola che contiene sedici magiche candeline, ognuna capace di realizzare un desiderio. In poco tempo, grazie al loro aiuto, diviene la ragazza più popolare e invidiata della scuola ma scopre che ogni cosa ottenuta ha comportato un elevato prezzo da pagare, perdendo gli ultimi anni di spensieratezza adolescenziale. Riuscirà a riavere indietro il suo mondo solo grazie all’aiuto dell’amico Jay (Jean-Luc Bilodeau)."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"The story about Abby Jensen, a girl who's been eager to reach her 16th birthday and has kept a secret wish list since she was a little girl. When the Big Day actually arrives, utter disaster strikes, leaving Abby to think her birthday is ruined. But when a mysterious box of magical birthday candles arrives to turn things around, Abby's 16 Wishes start to come true. Her day gets better and better...until she makes one wish that threatens to change everything.","tagline":"Everyone's sweet 16 is special, Abby's is magical."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aY1pNGm082gy0Iefr0DnzRNhmCI.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/53gLUhvVffVXSXOPAuXPeHkqEe9.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
